<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <div style="background-color: var(--bg-card); padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent-green); margin-bottom: 20px;">Defense & Best Practices</h1>
        <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem;">
          Building an impenetrable digital fortress requires consistency and discipline. Master these core principles to protect your data.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mt-4 mb-4 grid-2">
      <div>
        <h2 style="color: var(--accent-cyan); margin-bottom: 20px;">The 3-2-1 Backup Rule</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Data loss happens. Whether by ransomware, hardware failure, or human error, having a reliable backup strategy is your last line of defense.</p>
        <ul style="list-style-position: inside; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <li class="mb-2"><strong style="color: var(--text-main);">3 Copies of Data:</strong> The original, and at least two backups.</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><strong style="color: var(--text-main);">2 Different Media:</strong> E.g., one on an external hard drive, one on a NAS.</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><strong style="color: var(--text-main);">1 Offsite/Cloud:</strong> Store one copy in a different physical location (like a secure cloud provider) to protect against local disasters (fire, theft).</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="card mt-4" style="border-left: 4px solid #eab308;">
          <h4 style="color: #eab308; margin-bottom: 10px;">Pro Tip: Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)</h4>
          <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Always enable MFA on your critical accounts (Email, Banking, Password Manager). Even if a hacker steals your password, they cannot access your account without the second factor (like an authenticator app code).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 20px; font-family: var(--font-heading);">Personal Security Checklist</h3>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Track your progress to a safer digital life.</p>
        
        <div class="progress-bar-container">
          <div class="progress-bar" id="checklist-progress"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-right text-muted" id="progress-text" style="font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: right; margin-top: -15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">0%</p>

        <form id="checklist-form">
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Use a Password Manager</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Enable MFA on Email & Bank</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Turn on automatic OS updates</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Install a reputable Antivirus</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Setup a 3-2-1 backup system</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Review social media privacy settings</span>
          </label>
          <label class="checklist-item">
            <input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> 
            <span>Use a VPN on public Wi-Fi</span>
          </label>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>

  <script>
    const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.task-check');
    const progressBar = document.getElementById('checklist-progress');
    const progressText = document.getElementById('progress-text');

    function updateProgress() {
      const total = checkboxes.length;
      const checked = document.querySelectorAll('.task-check:checked').length;
      const percentage = Math.round((checked / total) * 100);
      
      progressBar.style.width = percentage + '%';
      progressText.textContent = percentage + '%';

      if (percentage === 100) {
        progressBar.style.backgroundColor = 'var(--accent-cyan)';
        showToast('Congratulations! You are officially secure!', 'success');
      } else {
        progressBar.style.backgroundColor = 'var(--accent-green)';
      }
    }

    checkboxes.forEach(cb => {
      cb.addEventListener('change', updateProgress);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
